<v Bill Clinton>I just have to try to put this in a little box like I have every other thing that has been said and done and go on and do my job. That's what I'm going to work at.
<v Bill Clinton>我必须试着把这一切像其他所有的言行一样放进一个小盒子里，然后继续做好我的工作。这就是我要努力的方向。

